        "description": "Verifies the SHA-256 chain of the consent and returns the broken link instead of a boolean: ok, broken_at (sequence number), reason (secuencia_rota, enlace_previo_incorrecto, hash_incorrecto, metadatos_alterados, cadena_incompleta, sin_cadena) and entries. A verified chain shows that the recorded text matches the published version; it does not prove that the subject read or freely accepted it.",
